  (Dd : Formalism.RepresentationBoundsCohomology.ringDataObjects.RingData (D.nd.O i) (D.nd.X i) (Fin D.R.nV) (GE D.nd) D.R.t (RepresentationBoundsCohomology.blk D.R))
